# Full-resolution menu photos as they came off the camera/phone. The shipped
# copies under public/images/menu/ are resized and compressed from these;
# these stay local so the repo doesn't carry both.
#
# Deliberately NOT inside public/ — everything under public/ is copied into
# the build verbatim, so parking them there quietly shipped 6.5 MB of images
# nobody ever loads. Being gitignored is not enough to keep a file out of a
# deploy.
photo-originals/
